cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "scada-schema: an open data standard for wind and PV SCADA"
abstract: >-
  One table schema for wind turbine and PV SCADA (names, units, sign and angle conventions, UTC interval start, device types),
  loaders that read open datasets (Kelmarsh, Penmanshiel, Hill of Towie, La Haute Borne, CARE to Compare, NREL PVDAQ) from their
  original files, a loader driven by a YAML mapping for other exports, resampling, 15 data quality checks with an HTML report,
  mapping of status codes to IEC 61400-26 categories, and converters to wind-up, OpenOA and pvlib with parity checks.
authors:
